# Catalan-Mihailescu Theorem

Catalan's conjecture / Mihailescu's theorem: The only solution in natural numbers to x^a - y^b = 1 with x, a, y, b > 1 is 3^2 - 2^3 = 1.

This repository is part of the Canonical Lane theorem collection.
The theorem is stated as the admissible-class closure
`constrained_theorem_closure : Prop` in `CatalanMihailescuTheoremCanonicalLaneLean/FinalTheorem.lean`.
-/

